Package: czcamera
Version: 1.0.0-m5stack1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: CardputerZero Camera <noreply@local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-picamera2, ffmpeg, alsa-utils, libjpeg62-turbo | libjpeg8, libfreetype6, libc6, libstdc++6
Description: Camera application for CardputerZero (photo, video, timelapse, gallery)
 Fullscreen 320x170 fbdev/evdev camera application (czcamera) and Picamera2
 subprocess worker (czcamera-cam) with 9 RGB24 filters, timelapse capture
 and MP4 assembly, gallery viewer, and on-device video playback.
